{{!
    @template mavrruntime_builtin/liveroom

    The live room panel of the built-in viewer: the notice about what joining shares (IP address
    included), the group room choice, join and leave, the voice controls and the people in the room.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region: mavr-live-notice, mavr-live-group, mavr-live-status, mavr-live-voice, mavr-live-ptt,
      mavr-live-insecure, mavr-live-people, mavr-live-participants, mavr-live-count
    * data-action: mavr-live-join, mavr-live-leave, mavr-live-mic, mavr-live-mute, mavr-live-talk

    Context variables required for this template:
    * cmid - course module id
    * canjoin - the user can join a room
    * nogroup - the user is in no group of the activity, so there is no room for them
    * secure - the page may use the microphone (a secure context)
    * hasgroups - the activity has group rooms to choose from
    * groups - [{id, name, selected}] the group rooms the user may join
    * maxpeers - most people in one room
    * count - people in the room shown in the heading (0 before joining)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "cmid": 12,
        "canjoin": true,
        "nogroup": false,
        "secure": true,
        "hasgroups": true,
        "groups": [{"id": 7, "name": "Group A", "selected": true}, {"id": 8, "name": "Group B", "selected": false}],
        "maxpeers": 6,
        "count": 0
    }
}}
<h3 class="h5" id="mavr-liveroom-heading-{{cmid}}">{{#str}}liveroom, mavrruntime_builtin{{/str}}</h3>
<p class="small" data-region="mavr-live-notice">{{#str}}livenotice, mavrruntime_builtin{{/str}}</p>
{{#nogroup}}
<p class="alert alert-info">{{#str}}livenogroup, mavrruntime_builtin{{/str}}</p>
{{/nogroup}}
{{#canjoin}}
<div class="mavr-live-controls d-flex flex-wrap align-items-end gap-2 mb-2">
    {{#hasgroups}}
    <div class="mavr-live-groupchoice">
        <label class="form-label mb-1" for="mavr-live-group-{{cmid}}">{{#str}}livegroupselect, mavrruntime_builtin{{/str}}</label>
        <select id="mavr-live-group-{{cmid}}" class="form-select" data-region="mavr-live-group">
            {{#groups}}
            <option value="{{id}}"{{#selected}} selected{{/selected}}>{{name}}</option>
            {{/groups}}
        </select>
    </div>
    {{/hasgroups}}
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-action="mavr-live-join">{{#str}}livejoin, mavrruntime_builtin{{/str}}</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary d-none" data-action="mavr-live-leave">{{#str}}liveleave, mavrruntime_builtin{{/str}}</button>
</div>
{{/canjoin}}
<p class="mavr-live-status mb-2" data-region="mavr-live-status" role="status"></p>
<div class="mavr-live-voice d-none mb-2" data-region="mavr-live-voice">
    {{#secure}}
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" data-action="mavr-live-mic">{{#str}}livemicon, mavrruntime_builtin{{/str}}</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" data-action="mavr-live-mute" aria-pressed="false" disabled>{{#str}}livemute, mavrruntime_builtin{{/str}}</button>
        <div class="form-check mb-0">
            <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" id="mavr-live-ptt-{{cmid}}" data-region="mavr-live-ptt">
            <label class="form-check-label" for="mavr-live-ptt-{{cmid}}">{{#str}}livepushtotalk, mavrruntime_builtin{{/str}}</label>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm d-none" data-action="mavr-live-talk" aria-pressed="false">{{#str}}liveholdtotalk, mavrruntime_builtin{{/str}}</button>
    </div>
    {{/secure}}
    {{^secure}}
    <p class="small text-muted mb-0" data-region="mavr-live-insecure">{{#str}}livemicinsecure, mavrruntime_builtin{{/str}}</p>
    {{/secure}}
</div>
<div class="mavr-live-people d-none" data-region="mavr-live-people">
    <h4 class="h6" data-region="mavr-live-count">{{#str}}liveparticipants, mavrruntime_builtin, {{count}}{{/str}}</h4>
    <ul class="list-unstyled mavr-live-participants mb-0" data-region="mavr-live-participants"></ul>
</div>
